OL,3,GNEWSASeveral bank holiday ferry
OL,4,Aservices cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of morning sailings on a
OL,7,Fpassenger ferry service between
OL,8,FPortsmouth and the Isle of Wight have
OL,9,Fbeen cancelled due to a problem with
OL,10,Fthe vessel's exhaust.
OL,12,FWightlink said the FastCat sailings at
OL,13,F07:15 BST and 08:15 from Portsmouth
OL,14,FHarbour, as well as the 07:45 sailing
OL,15,Ffrom Ryde Pier Head, were cancelled on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FIt comes after all services were
OL,19,Fsuspended on Sunday and several
OL,20,Fhovercraft crossings between Ryde and
OL,21,FSouthsea were cancelled on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
