OL,3,GNEWSASeveral bank holiday ferry
OL,4,Aservices cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry firm said all Wightlink
OL,7,Ftickets will continue to be accepted on
OL,8,Fits Portsmouth to Fishbourne car ferry
OL,9,Fservice, and Hovertravel will be
OL,10,Foperating services between Southsea and
OL,11,FRyde, with Wightlink tickets being
OL,12,Faccepted.
